{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>All kinds of shelves, colorful books, and a warm little shop!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf by Shelf is a cozy simulation game that blends the love of books with a relaxing organizing experience. Arrange books on shelves, sort them by genre, and decorate your store. Spending time in a tidy and warm bookshop will make you feel great!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.poster.avif?t=1761843999\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.webm?t=1761843999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.mp4?t=1761843999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Shelf by Shelf?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd86 <strong>A Place for Everything</strong><br>Whether it\u2019s colorful books with vibrant covers or your personal items, organize your shelves just the way you like. Fill them up, enrich your collection, and create libraries that appeal to every reader!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>From Dusty Shelves to Grand Libraries</strong><br>Start with a cozy reading corner and grow into a bustling bookstore filled to the brim. Expand your space with new furniture, decorations, and collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcad <strong>Requests Come In, You Deliver</strong><br>From local residents to book clubs, fulfill orders for different customers, prepare special collections, and invest your earnings back into your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 <strong>Your Shop, Your Style</strong><br>Colorful covers, elegant furniture, and character-filled decorations\u2026 All the details to make your bookstore unique are in your hands!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.poster.avif?t=1761843999\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.webm?t=1761843999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.mp4?t=1761843999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Soft-toned, warm, and comforting visuals<br>\u2714 Relaxing and smooth organizing mechanics<br>\u2714 Carefully selected literary works to expand your general knowledge<br>\u2714 A gameplay pace that soothes rather than stresses<br>\u2714 Hidden little surprises waiting to be discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Shelf by Shelf</strong> to your wishlist so you can be the first to fill those shelves!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Book Sold!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943720/f971fd9f7eb806f9ca584f6cbce9a8ef60595481.jpg"},{"name":"Spotless Shelves!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943720/ae18b141518b266103ff9de4c9024321fdbc9a68.jpg"},{"name":"Order Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943720/d8b6014cc5c26c1fadcfdf02680ff45ad3a9d123.jpg"},{"name":"Decoration is Our Thing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943720/995a517af3fdeade4ca665eedd9bf71856185b51.jpg"},{"name":"My Lil' Sweetheart 